    microbes, the smell of a forest in rain — all real, all with units. The right of the chart has no units
    at all, and the honest test is that one: <em>what is it measured in, and by what instrument?</em> If
    nobody can answer, the claim is poetry. Poetry is permitted here. It is simply not evidence, and the
