    <p class="kicker" style="text-align:center">Closing Stance</p>
    <p class="creed-line">Cut the stave. Know the history. Claim nothing you cannot measure.</p>
    <p class="muted small" style="text-align:center;max-width:58ch;margin:0 auto">
      The runes do not need to be magic to be worth a life's attention. They are a writing system invented by
      people who had no writing, cut into wood by hands that then carried the comb home — and that is a
      stranger and better fact than any power attributed to them since. Honour them by reading them
      accurately, including the part of their history that is shameful.</p>
